flowchart LR
  O[Operator / incident view]
  subgraph GCP[Google Cloud deployment boundary]
    CP[Continuum control plane\nGoogle ADK orchestration]
    REG[Registry projection\nstatus + epoch + digest]
    EVT[(Firestore\nappend-only events + projections)]
    PS[Pub/Sub\nat-least-once events]
    GEM[Vertex AI\nGemini 3.5+ proposals]
    AG1[Agent v17\nCloud Run identity A]
    AG2[Agent v18\nCloud Run identity B]
    MG[Memory gateway\ngrant filter before retrieval]
    AX[Action gateway\nepoch + policy + idempotency]
    OT[Cloud Trace / Logging\nOpenTelemetry]
    CC[Continuity Contract\nportable artifacts]
    IV[Independent verifier / attestor]
  end
  EXT[(Sandbox vendor registry)]

  O -->|start / approve / inspect| CP
  CP -->|append + project| EVT
  EVT -->|outbox event| PS
  PS -->|missed expectation| CP
  CP -->|cited evidence only| GEM
  GEM -->|typed proposal; no authority| CP
  CP -->|resolve eligible successor| REG
  AG1 -. stale epoch denied .-> AX
  AG1 -. revoked grant denied .-> MG
  AG2 -->|scoped retrieval| MG
  AG2 -->|decision + epoch + key| AX
  AX -->|one reconcilable effect| EXT
  EVT -->|obligation + evidence digests| CC
  REG -->|grant + manifest + revocation proof| CC
  AX -->|execution receipt| CC
  EXT -->|independent provider observation| IV
  CC -->|complete artifact chain| IV
  IV -->|continuity attestation| CC
  CP --> OT
  PS --> OT
  AX --> OT
